        "substitutes": "USGS lists depleted uranium alloys or hardened steel as potential substitutes for tungsten alloys in armour-piercing projectiles, in some cases at higher cost or lower performance.",
        "stockpile": "The fiscal 2025 plan allowed purchases of up to 2,041 tonnes of contained tungsten, and listed 499 tonnes of tungsten in ores for possible sale.",
        "capacity": "Tungsten has not been mined commercially in the United States since 2015. A processing plant in South Korea received operating certificates on 17 September 2026 (company statement).",
