        "quantity_scope": "rare earths, order of magnitude",
        "quantity": "GAO, citing its 2016 report and Department of Defense estimates: total defence demand for rare earths “is less than 0.1 percent of the global demand”, and about 9,200 pounds are needed for each Virginia-class submarine. The figures are for rare earths and not for magnets.",
